# G0.3: Markdown type resolution inside the harness app WITH an imported type declaration
environment: simulator, iPhone 17, iOS 26.5 (Sylvia-M0-g03-intake), 2026-10-06
build: commit 0464ef6, whose Spikes/G03-Intake/App/Harness/Info.plist declared UTImportedTypeDeclarations for
  net.daringfireball.markdown (conforms to public.plain-text) with extensions md, markdown, mdown, mkd, mkdn
command: Scripts/ci.d/50-g03-intake.sh (trial run), step 7, test InAppLayoutTests.markdownTypes
result: the import does not change resolution; only .md maps to the Markdown type. The declaration was removed
  afterwards and intake maps Markdown extensions explicitly (SupportedContent.markdownExtensions).
